senses.gloss:
√math or manth (mathnā́ti, mathnīté;
mánthati; máthati [746]; mamā́tha, mamathús,
mamanthús, methús; ámathīt;
mathiṣyáti, -te, manthiṣyáti; mathitá;
máthitum; mathitvā́; -máthya).
 —1. stir or whirl; w. agnim, produce fire
by whirling the stick of attrition in a dry
piece of wood;
 —2. shake, agitate, distress.
+ pra, agitate.
